{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51371","headline":"东山寺（在黄梅县） · 白居易","name":"东山寺（在黄梅县）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直上青霄望八都，白云影里月轮孤。\n茫茫宇宙人无数，几个男儿是丈夫。\n（《弘治黄州府志》七《艺文》）（曹汛谓《全唐诗》卷八五八吕岩《絶句》三十二首之十四，後二句与此全同，前句稍异，作白诗疑误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}